From: X710 mainline port <bringup@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] power: supply: isolate one OFF-mode SM5440 ADC comparison

Default-off condition experiment with no companion publication, pump activation
or PPS consumer. Normal charging/passive builds keep their existing behavior.

--- a/drivers/power/supply/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/power/supply/Kconfig
@@ -1211 +1211,9 @@
+config SM5440_ADC_CONDITION_TEST
+	bool "X710 one OFF-mode SM5440 ENHIZ/ADC comparison"
+	depends on CHARGER_SM5440_DIRECT=y && !X710_CHARGING_POLICY
+	help
+	  One diagnostic conversion with bit7-only temporary ENHIZ adjustment
+	  and verified restoration. No pump ON, PPS or charging authorization.
+	  Leave disabled for normal or previously accepted passive builds.
+
 endif # POWER_SUPPLY
